{% block content %}
<section class="quiz-hero shortcut-hero typing-hero">
<div class="quiz-hero-text">
<p class="eyebrow">Athanas Inspires Tools</p>
<h1>Typing Speed Trainer</h1>
<p>Build keyboard confidence through simple typing practice. Train speed, accuracy, focus, and ICT vocabulary while learning that mistakes are part of progress.</p>
<div class="quiz-hero-actions">
<a class="btn" href="#typingTrainer">Start Typing</a>
<a class="btn secondary-btn" href="index.html">Back to Tools</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<main class="typing-page" id="main-content">
<section aria-label="Athanas Inspires Typing Speed Trainer" class="typing-app-card">
<div class="quiz-topbar typing-topbar">
<div>
<p class="calc-mini-title">Keyboard Confidence Zone</p>
<h2>Train Typing Speed</h2>
</div>
<div class="typing-best-pill" id="typingBestPill">Best: 0 WPM</div>
</div>
<div class="typing-controls-row">
<div>
<p class="typing-control-label">Choose practice type</p>
<div aria-label="Typing practice categories" class="shortcut-category-tabs typing-category-tabs" id="typingCategoryTabs">
<button class="category-tab active" data-category="Beginner" type="button">Beginner</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="ICT Words" type="button">ICT Words</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Sentences" type="button">Sentences</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-category="Focus Challenge" type="button">Focus Challenge</button>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="typing-control-label">Choose time</p>
<div aria-label="Typing duration" class="typing-duration-tabs" id="typingDurationTabs">
<button class="category-tab" data-duration="30" type="button">30 sec</button>
<button class="category-tab active" data-duration="60" type="button">60 sec</button>
<button class="category-tab" data-duration="120" type="button">120 sec</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-grid typing-status-grid">
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Time Left</span>
<strong id="typingTimer">60s</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Speed</span>
<strong id="typingWpm">0 WPM</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Accuracy</span>
<strong id="typingAccuracy">100%</strong>
</div>
<div class="quiz-status-card">
<span>Mistakes</span>
<strong id="typingMistakes">0</strong>
</div>
</div>
<div class="athanas-tool-note">
<strong>Coach Athanas:</strong> Do not chase speed before accuracy. Type calmly first, correct your fingers slowly, then speed will follow like a student who finally understood the topic.
        </div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="quiz-progress">
<div class="quiz-progress-bar" id="typingProgressBar"></div>
</div>
<article class="typing-practice-card">
<div class="typing-passage-header">
<div>
<div class="question-tag" id="typingTag">Beginner</div>
<h3>Type the text below</h3>
</div>
<button class="small-btn typing-small-action" id="newTypingText" type="button">New Text</button>
</div>
<div aria-label="Text to type" class="typing-passage" id="typingPassage"></div>
<label class="typing-input-label" for="typingInput">Your typing area</label>
<textarea class="typing-input" id="typingInput" placeholder="Click Start, then type here..." rows="7"></textarea>
<div aria-live="polite" class="typing-live-message" id="typingLiveMessage">Ready when you are. Start slowly and let your confidence grow.</div>
</article>
<div class="quiz-actions typing-actions">
<button class="btn quiz-control" id="startTypingBtn" type="button">Start Typing</button>
<button class="btn outline-btn quiz-control" id="resetTypingBtn" type="button">Reset</button>
</div>
</section>
<aside class="typing-side-panel">
<div class="side-card quiz-result-card" id="typingResultCard">
<h3>Your Typing Result</h3>
<p id="typingResultSummary">Start a typing round and your result will appear here.</p>
<div class="result-score-circle typing-score-circle" id="typingResultCircle">0</div>
<button class="small-btn outline-btn share-score-btn" id="shareTypingScore" type="button">Share My Result</button>
<a class="small-btn" href="shortcut-keys-trainer.html">Train Shortcuts</a>
<a class="small-btn submit-btn" href="ict-quiz.html">Play ICT Quiz</a>
</div>
<div class="side-card learning-card athanas-identity-card">
<h3>Typing Growth Path</h3>
<ul>
<li>First goal: type without fear.</li>
<li>Second goal: improve accuracy.</li>
<li>Third goal: increase speed little by little.</li>
<li>Final goal: use typing to learn, work, and create faster.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="side-card learning-card">
<h3>Practice Tips</h3>
<ul>
<li>Keep both hands on the keyboard.</li>
<li>Look at the screen more than your fingers.</li>
<li>Do not rush the first round.</li>
<li>Repeat the same level until your accuracy improves.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="side-card shortcut-mini-list typing-mini-list">
<h3>Typing Targets</h3>
<div><span>Beginner</span><strong>10–20 WPM</strong></div>
<div><span>Growing</span><strong>21–35 WPM</strong></div>
<div><span>Good</span><strong>36–50 WPM</strong></div>
<div><span>Strong</span><strong>51+ WPM</strong></div>
</div>
</aside>
</main>
{% endblock %}

